---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Creates & links a cloud project if needed, previews cost, and ships the first deployment

Usage: launch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --name <NAME>
          Project display name (defaults to `[app].name` in leptoskit.toml)

      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --region <REGION>
          Region slug (defaults to `[cloud].region` or the cloud default)

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

  -y, --yes
          Skip interactive confirmation after printing the release preview

      --detach
          Return as soon as the deployment is queued without following logs

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

  -h, --help
          Print help
